<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">InCoM: Intent-Driven Perception and Structured Coordination for 
<br class="ltx_break">Whole-Body Mobile Manipulation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
